DECISIONS 213, CODEGEN.md §2.1, §3.5: a dependency's go emit check refused for its missing out has no package, so its importer does not refuse the empty import name again (no E8011 there).
-- b/b.canon --
package b

/// A colour.
enum Tone { red, blue }

emit go { mode: baked }
-- a/a.canon --
package a

import b { Tone }

/// A badge.
record Badge {
  /// Its colour.
  tone: Tone
}

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8009]  b/b.canon:6:6
  emit go is missing out

1 error, 0 warnings in 2 packages (…)
